            "meaning": "The unchanged CP and pitchValueKnown=false guard activates the missing canonical free/bollard pitch pair with bollard=0.7*free. The free-running quantity is missing, not merely numerically discrepant.",
            "query_sha256": "d82d557916269860405145219a7519c8acde924b6e0f3e5a0669ab71d19ba49e",
            "query": "\n            PREFIX nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>\n            PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>\n            PREFIX unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/>\n            PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this nltl:propellerType ?type ;\n                      nltl:pitchValueKnown false .\n                FILTER (?type = \"CP\"^^xsd:string)\n\n                FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n                    $this nltl:propellerPitchAtMcrFreeRunning ?free ;\n                          nltl:propellerPitchAtMcrBollard ?bollard .\n                    ?free qudt:numericValue ?freeValue ;\n                          qudt:unit unit:M .\n                    ?bollard qudt:numericValue ?bollardValue ;\n                             qudt:unit unit:M .\n                    FILTER (datatype(?freeValue) = xsd:decimal)\n                    FILTER (datatype(?bollardValue) = xsd:decimal)\n                    FILTER (\n                        ABS(?bollardValue - (0.7 * ?freeValue)) <=\n                        (0.000001 * ABS(0.7 * ?freeValue) + 0.000000001)\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        ",
